  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/banner_castle.png\" alt=\"# Vampirism.co - 你的超自然世界\"></p>\n<h3>本模组是 Vampirism.co 的一个小型附加组件，增添了一些小特色，并无特别之处。</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/f2SRBu5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/badge_discord.svg\" alt=\"在 Discord 上与我们交流！\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvampirism.co%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/badge_website.svg\" alt=\"访问网站\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvampirism.co%252fwiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/badge_documentation.svg\" alt=\"阅读文档\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fvampirism.co\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/badge_modrinth.svg\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 获取\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvampirism.co%252finstall-curseforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/badge_curseforge.svg\" alt=\"可在 CurseForge 获取\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvampirism.co%252finstall-technic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/badge_techniclauncher.svg\" alt=\"可在 TechnicLauncher 获取\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvampirism.co%252finstall-manually\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vampirism.co/files/badge_prismlauncher.svg\" alt=\"可在 Prism Launcher 获取\"></a></p>",
